  "scope": "Share the subtraction-free Pell norm balance",
  "validation": "Paired targets, four direct clients and two source-pinned seven-module combined chains through HalfIndex pass. All 78 existing target declarations, selected direct-client reports, global simp and instances match; combined HalfIndex has 38 identical declaration/type/axiom reports, 28,977 matching simp and 13,170 matching instance entries.",
  "limitations": [
    "One public norm_advance_balance theorem is added, visible to three direct and 51 transitive source clients in the local DiophantineConsistency import graph; clients outside that graph are not counted.",
    "PellCongruences, PellKnownUnit, HalfIndex and some combined intermediate object hashes differ; reports cover existing declarations and registrations but do not imply byte-identical objects.",
    "Target and endpoint timing samples were single paired runs under shared load. External dependencies and further transitive project providers remain cached.",
    "An ad hoc verification command initially failed on an optional field, then was corrected; no Lean build or probe failed.",
    "The combined baseline Periodicity and ResidueClasses snapshots predate the separate reflection commit; they match that commit\u2019s parent rather than this balance commit\u2019s parent. The combined final lane contains both changes."
  ],
